From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek Kekane <akekane@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 06:37:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Block restricted addresses in web-download import URIs

Reject import URIs targeting loopback, link-local, private, reserved,
multicast, or unspecified addresses unless the host is listed in
allowed_hosts. Also reject hostnames that resolve to those addresses.

On stable/2025.1, FunctionalTest servers need allowed_hosts in conf
(via self.allowed_hosts) because self.config() does not affect the
API subprocess.

OSISM: rebased onto the 2024.1 code base from the identical patch in
the 2024.2 series (osism/container-images-kolla#790). Content is
unchanged; only hunk offsets and context differ, so the From line above
carries no upstream commit id.

Closes-Bug: #2158998
SecurityImpact

